 your views on global issues?","What responsibility do we have toward other countries?","Have you learned about other countries in school?","Which countries interest you the most?","Would you like to travel to another country?","What would you want to see there?","How can we promote global understanding?","Is learning languages important for global citizenship?","How many languages do you speak?","Would you like to learn another language?","What's the best way to learn a language?","Have you made friends from other countries?","How did you meet them?","Do you think cultural exchange is valuable?","How does climate change affect our daily lives?","How much water does the average person use daily?","Have you noticed changes in the weather?","What causes climate change?","Have you participated in any environmental projects?","What environmental practices do you follow?","Do you recycle?","Have you tried to reduce your plastic use?","Is it difficult to be environmentally conscious?","Do you think governments should do more?","What environmental laws would you create?","What was your experience?","How can schools promote environmental awareness?","Do you think your school is environmentally friendly?","Is renewable energy important?","Have you learned about renewable energy sources?","Would you want solar panels on your house?","How important is biodiversity?","Have you visited any national parks or nature reserves?","What endangered animals do you know about?","How can we protect endangered species?","Should we prioritize animal welfare?","What role do plants play in our ecosystem?","How can we conserve water?","Is pollution in your area a problem?","How does pollution affect human health?","What industries cause the most pollution?","Can we balance industry and environmental protection?","Do you think technology can solve environmental problems?","What technological innovations excite you?","How do you want to contribute to the world?","What skills are you developing?","Do you want to work in an environmental field?","What other careers interest you?","How will you prepare for your chosen career?","Do you think education is the most important tool?","Have you traveled for educational purposes?","What educational opportunities are you taking?","Do you think global problems require global solutions?","How can different countries work together?","Is international cooperation difficult?","What international organizations do you know about?","Do you think the United Nations is effective?","What changes would you make to global governance?","Is poverty a global issue that concerns you?","Is access to healthcare a global right?","Have you thought about global inequality?","What responsibility do wealthy countries have?","Do you think you can make a global impact?","What's your first step toward global citizenship?","How do you stay informed about world events?","What news sources do you trust?","Together, we can build a better future for everyone."]}
